{"path":"locale/numpunct/decimal_point","title":"std::numpunct<CharT>::decimal_point, do_decimal_point","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::numpunct&lt;CharT&gt;::</span>decimal_point, do_decimal_point","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/numpunct/decimal_point","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"The value of type char_type to use as the decimal separator. The standard specializations of std::numpunct return '.' and L'.'.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">public</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br>char_type decimal_point<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span><br><span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> char_type do_decimal_point<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Public member function, calls the member function <code>do_decimal_point</code> of the most derived class.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns the character to be used as the decimal separator between integer and fractional parts. </div>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>The value of type <code>char_type</code> to use as the decimal separator. The standard specializations of <code>std::numpunct</code> return <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">'.'</span></span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">L<span class=\"st0\">'.'</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;locale&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> slash <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/numpunct\"><span class=\"kw1978\">std::<span class=\"me2\">numpunct</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> do_decimal_point<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span> <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"st0\">'/'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"br0\">}</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// separate with slash</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">precision</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">10</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"default locale: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1234.5678</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">imbue</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\"><span class=\"kw1911\">std::<span class=\"me2\">locale</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a>.<span class=\"me1\">getloc</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, new slash<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"locale with modified numpunct: \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"nu16\">1234.5678</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>default locale: 1234.5678\nlocale with modified numpunct: 1234/5678</code></pre> \n</div>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/numpunct","title":"std::numpunct"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::numpunct<CharT>::decimal_point, do_decimal_point","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Public member function, calls the member function do_decimal_point of the most derived class."},{"label":"Return value","note":"The value of type char_type to use as the decimal separator. The standard specializations of std::numpunct return '.' and L'.'."},{"label":"Example"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":124,"codeBlockCount":2}
